# Campaign state is committed on purpose: it is how a scheduled run in a fresh
# container knows who has already been emailed. These files are the exception,
# and they are ignored here rather than merely left uncommitted, so that a
# secret cannot reach the repository even if some future code path writes one.
#
#   sender__*    a live OAuth refresh token for the sender's university mailbox
#   settings__*  the user's own NVIDIA NIM API key
#   oauthstate__ short-lived CSRF nonces, worthless to keep and unwise to publish
#
# The tokens belong in the environment instead. See GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN.
sender__*.json
settings__*.json
oauthstate__*.json
